"$A/$2B-$u$n.$x` θα δημιουργούσε εγγραφή με όνομα "
"`/path/to/recordings/Bones/Season 2/06-The Girl in Suite 2103.ts`."

#: src/docs_inc.c:5426 src/docs_inc.c:5490
msgid ""
"Without a precedence rule, the two sources can overwrite each other on every"
